<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><title>Reports</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css"></head><body><aside class="sidebar"><jsp:include page="/sidebar.jsp" /></aside><main class="main"><header class="topbar"><div><h1>Reports</h1><p>A quick operational summary of the system</p></div></header><section class="stats"><div class="stat"><div class="stat-icon blue">👨‍🎓</div><div><span>Total Students</span><strong><%=request.getAttribute("totalStudents")%></strong><small>All student records</small></div></div><div class="stat"><div class="stat-icon green">✓</div><div><span>Active Students</span><strong><%=request.getAttribute("activeStudents")%></strong><small>Active records</small></div></div><div class="stat"><div class="stat-icon purple">📚</div><div><span>Courses</span><strong><%=request.getAttribute("totalCourses")%></strong><small>Active courses</small></div></div><div class="stat"><div class="stat-icon gold">▣</div><div><span>Marks Entries</span><strong><%=request.getAttribute("totalMarks")%></strong><small>Saved mark records</small></div></div></section><div class="panel info-panel"><h2>What this report covers</h2><p>This module currently provides a live system summary. It can later be extended with course-wise performance, attendance, top performers, exports and date-based reporting.</p><div class="notice">Tip: Use <b>Marksheet</b> to view an individual student's complete result.</div></div></main></body></html>
